  "problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=cos\u2061x?$\n\n- The function is zero at $x=\\frac{3\\pi }{2}.$\n- Its range is $y\\in [-2,2]$\n- $y=-\\frac{3}{2}$ is an output of the function",
